  "findings": [
    [
      "native_OS20_resident_two_stream_command_worker",
      "native/os20-task-bridge/resident-contract-v1.json",
      "Same compiled worker and original TCB/adapter handle two START/STOP generations and four SBC frames. 1024 PCM bytes match upstream independent-stream references. Ten native C commands, one entry, one occupied adapter slot; no per-frame/restart task creation."
    ],
    [
      "native_OS20_resident_C_controller_POST_WAIT",
      "staging/native-os20-resident-music-file-v2/ROOT_FILE-proof-v2.json",
      "All command publications and acknowledgements after dispatch are guest C stores and original POST/WAIT calls. Native idle heartbeat tests already-blocked WAIT; acknowledgements also exercise command POST before worker WAIT. 28 original context destinations total; controller and worker remain in native WAIT at final idle marker."
    ],
    [
      "native_OS20_resident_failure_prefix_and_FILE_seal",
      "staging/native-os20-resident-music-file-v2/ROOT_FILE-proof-v2.json",
      "v1 failed wrong ARM pointer for Thumb CURRENT helper; corrected to358D25. Reused only FILE-sealed 3865 original instructions/1826 stores before first compiled controller instruction, excluded bad call. FILEv1 Path/string setup error checked no tail stores; FILEv2 checks new26224 store EA-values/55 ABI returns/27 contexts and18 whole final regions. No completed native creation/restore prefix or guest rerun; no new independent agent/full nonstore interpreter."
    ],
    [
      "native_OS20_resident_STOP_not_audio_STOP_DONE",
      "native/os20-task-bridge/resident-contract-v1.json",
      "Duplicate active START=-16 preserves decoder history; stopped DECODE=-11 leaves output/result unchanged. Decoder STOP keeps root/task/adapter/descriptor/stack/module resident. One-controller, one-outstanding-command pinned fixture; no full audio STOP_DONE, heap reclamation, safe unload, GUI, native App, direct phone A2DP or speaker proof."
    ]
  ],
  "details": [
    "常駐OS20解碼工作完成兩段串流：同一TCB與適配槽收到原機C控制程式的10個指令，四個SBC音框輸出1,024-byte PCM，與上游兩次獨立啟動的參考逐byte一致；工作只進入一次，停止／重啟沒有新增工作槽。",
    "控制流程包含START、音框、重複START拒絕、STOP、停止後音框拒絕、再START及第二段音框。啟動兩次才reset解碼器，重複START回−16保留history，停止後音框回−11且輸出／結果的canary保持；第二段證明舊synthesis history已清除。",
    "原POST／WAIT／context restore實際執行，C idle送一次heartbeat讓工作先進入等待，再測喚醒；後續指令也測到POST先於worker WAIT。全程28個原context目的地，最終controller與worker仍在原WAIT，idle恢復；10次指令與完成序號都由對應C工作寫入。",
    "首版把原CURRENT Thumb函式用ARM指標呼叫，native controller檢查失敗；新指標358D25修正，僅接續已封存的3,865條原建立／restore前綴，沒有重跑前綴或執行錯誤呼叫。FILE首版在Path／字串組合處失敗，尚未核對tail；新版核對26,224個新store地址和值、55個新完整返回及27個新context；合併28,050 stores／64 returns／18完整區域。",
    "這個STOP只停止解碼指令，不是完整音訊STOP_DONE或安全卸載；原root／stack／TCB／adapter仍常駐。初始ready仍是bootstrap輸入，完整boot／CPU／cache／MMU與實機App未驗證。下一步接既有copied-media／typed PCM FIFO與Source／mixer，再接GUI與實機載入。整體37%、App40%保持。"
  ],
